.TH SHB-VERSION 1 "October 2026" "SecretHarbor 0.1.0" "SecretHarbor Manual"
.SH NAME
shb-version \- Show SecretHarbor version and security subsystem details
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBshb version\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
Displays the SecretHarbor version, platform, OS kernel, active sandbox driver, and policy specification version.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
$ \fBshb version\fR
.TP
$ \fBshb --version\fR
.TP
$ \fBshb -v\fR
.SH SEE ALSO
shb(1)
.SH WEBSITE
https://github.com/logn10/SecretHarbor
